@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@knowledgeBaseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 创建知识库：执行后将响应 id 复制到上面的 knowledgeBaseId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "研发知识库",
  "description": "存放部署手册与接口文档"
}

### 分页列表：page 从 0 开始
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases?page=0&size=20

### 详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{knowledgeBaseId}}

### 参数校验示例：预期 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}
